=== PARITY (vs web SignalCatalogPanel.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> bound via the shared seam (SignalCatalogPanelSource -> …Model):
    useSignalGaps (GET /signals/{id}/live, poll 5s -> Record<name,{value,timestamp}|scalar>)
    is the production source; useTranslation -> SignalCatalogPanelStrings; useSignalGaps's
    derived state (search/filterMode/sortMode useState) -> model search/filterMode/sortMode.
    The view performs NO HTTP.
  Adapter (cached -> projection) faithfully ports:
    - value: `value != null ? String(value) : '—'` (null/undefined -> em-dash; number via
      JS String(); bool "true"/"false"; string verbatim).
    - staleness = (now - ts)/1000 s; ts absent -> Infinity.
    - category (SignalRow.category): never (no ts) | stale (>300) | active (<=300).
    - status badge (getCatalogStalenessStyle): never | active(<30) | aging(<300) | stale.
    - formatStaleness: <60 "{int}s ago"; <3600 "{int}m ago"; else "{h}h {int}m ago".
    - summary StatCards: Total / Active(<30s)=category active / Stale(>5min)=category stale /
      Never Received=category never (the web "Active (<30s)" label counts category active —
      <=300s — reproduced VERBATIM incl. the label, not silently "fixed").
    - filter: trimmed case-insensitive name substring + mode (stale keeps stale+never;
      active keeps active). sort: staleness(desc, Infinity/never first) | alpha(localeCompare)
      | category(never<stale<active). Stable, ties preserve order.
    - selection disabled: !checked && max != null && count >= max.
    Proven by an EXECUTED host harness (42/42 below).
  Composition -> native primitives (no Tailwind): 4 summary StatCards (TSStatCard, responsive
    grid), then a glass panel (TSGlassPanel) with a header (title + freshness chip + "Refreshes
    every 5s" + refresh), a search field (magnifyingglass + prompt + aria-label), filter chips,
    sort chips, then an adaptive table — a columnar SwiftUI Grid (Status / Signal / Last Value /
